        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Melissa George, Tom Wilkinson, Jai Courtney, Robert Mackenzie\n- Films and TV: Felony, Home and Away, Animal Kingdom, The Hunter, Lore, The Grandmaster, The Rover, Deadline Gallipoli, Partisan, Lion, Hacksaw Ridge\n- Roles: actress, sound engineer, model, national rollerskating champion\n- Events: 89th Academy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Melissa George was born on 6 August 1976 and is an Australian-American actress.\n- Melissa George was a national rollerskating champion and model in Australia before acting.\n- Melissa George played Angel Parrish on the Australian soap opera Home and Away from 1993 to 1996.\n- Felony is a film in which Tom Wilkinson, Jai Courtney, and Melissa George appeared.\n- Robert Mackenzie is a sound engineer best known for work on Animal Kingdom (2010), The Hunter (2011), Lore (2012), Felony (2013), The Grandmaster (2013), The Rover (2014), Deadline Gallipoli (2015), Partisan (2015), Lion, and Hacksaw Ridge.\n- Robert Mackenzie received Academy Award nominations for Best Sound Editing and Best Sound Mixing for Hacksaw Ridge at the 89th Academy Awards.",
